  "title": "Mexican Bean Stew",
  "description": "Pinto, black and garbanzo beans are simmered with fresh corn, tomatoes and savory spices. This recipe calls for dry beans, which will need to soak overnight.",
  "authors": [
    "Donalyn"
  ],
